        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Acorn MT5BL, Adobe Iron Single Cylinder Lockset With Lever</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nIron entrysets are good for adding a touch of old world beauty to your home without dating it; so a unique handleset like this is perfect for new and historic homes. Because of its rough black finish, the Dummy Adobe Iron Handleset With Lever has a rustic feel that will add texture to your doors. Dummy handlesets are most often used as a pull on the inactive side of double doors to match the existing trim.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching <a href=\"/products/adobe-iron-single-cylinder-handleset-with-lever-acorn-mt5bi\"><b>Adobe Iron Single Cylinder Handleset With Lever</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Dummy Adobe Iron Handleset With Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Black Iron</b></li>\r\n<li>Exterior Handleset Length: 11-1/4”</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Handleset Width: 3-3/8”</li>\r\n<li>Interior Lever Length: 3\"</li>\r\n<li><b>Lifetime Finish Warranty</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Dummy Handleset:</b> Usually used as matching trim for the non-working side of double doors it does not latch and does not lock. Blank cylinder and non-functional thumbpiece on the exterior. Rigid turnpiece and lever on the interior.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<a href=\"/pages/how-to-order-door-hardware\"><b>Click Here to Determine Handing</b></a>\r\n</p>",
